OL,3,AUS-Canada trade war escalates as Trump
OL,4,Athreatens tariff hike on autos after
OL,5,ACarney vows to retaliate
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Mark Carney called
OL,8,FTrump's latest levy threat unsurprising
OL,9,Fand accused the president of wanting to
OL,10,Fdestroy Canada's auto industry. He
OL,11,Fadded that Canada is ready to resume
OL,12,Ftalks if the US comes with the "right
OL,13,Fattitude".
